                "html": "<div class=\"hero-interior\"><div class=\"hero-interior__inner\"><div class=\"hero-interior__eyebrow\">Responsible Agentic AI</div><h1 class=\"hero-interior__headline\">The Inner Circle.</h1><p class=\"hero-interior__subheadline\">A private mentoring circle for using agentic AI the right way — no hype, no shortcuts, no calling yourself an \"AI expert\" after one webinar.</p></div></div>"
