              "id": "875bb64",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--warm\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">What you get in the circle</h2><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤖</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Agents, Not Chatbots</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Real agentic workflows that act — not just prompts that chat. Built, tested, and deployed with guardrails.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛡️</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Risk First</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Before any agent touches real work: what can go wrong, what's the blast radius, and how do you verify? Always.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Verifiable Outputs</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Agents that hallucinate quietly are worse than no agents. We mentor on checking, auditing, and validating every output.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">👥</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Human in the Loop</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Automation that serves people, not replaces them. The circle debates the ethics, not just the tech.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
