              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--light\"><div class=\"section__inner--narrow\"><h2 class=\"section__headline\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Join the Circle</h2><div class=\"section__body section__body--center\"><p>Agentic AI is the new wild west. Everyone's selling courses. Almost no one is mentoring. The Inner Circle is a small, private group where Jason &amp; Tyler actually walk with you — building agents responsibly, thinking through the risks, and skipping the hype entirely.</p></div><div class=\"pricing-card reveal\"><div class=\"pricing-card__badge\">Membership</div><div class=\"pricing-card__price\">$12<span>/yr</span></div><div class=\"pricing-card__period\">A year of responsible agentic AI mentorship. Less than a coffee a month.</div><ul class=\"pricing-card__list\"><li class=\"pricing-card__item\">Monthly live mentoring sessions with Jason &amp; Tyler</li><li class=\"pricing-card__item\">Responsible agentic AI frameworks &amp; checklists</li><li class=\"pricing-card__item\">Private community for honest questions</li><li class=\"pricing-card__item\">Early access to tools, experiments &amp; case studies</li><li class=\"pricing-card__item\">No upsells. No \"masterclass\" spam. Ever.</li></ul><a href=\"demo-contact.html\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--arrow pricing-card__cta\">Request to Join →</a></div></div></div>"
              },
